Value Required SYNC_MODE ([*+=-])
Value Required REMOTE (\S+)
Value LOCAL (\S+)
Value STRATUM (\d+)
Value POLL (\d+)
Value REACH (\d+)
Value DELAY ([\d.]+)
Value VRF (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*${SYNC_MODE}${REMOTE}\s+${LOCAL}\s+${STRATUM}\s+${POLL}\s+${REACH}\s+${DELAY}(?:\s+${VRF})?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*
